          Z" fill="#acf86c"></path></g></svg><div class="hrt-progress-circle-inner"><div style="margin-left: 4px;">25<sup>%</sup></div></div></div></div><div><h2 class="hrt-text-body-lg hrt-font-bold hrt-mb-0 hrt-tracking-tight hrt-leading-heading"><span>$870</span> <!-- -->raised <span class="hrt-text-supporting hrt-font-regular">of</span>&nbsp;<button class="hrt-text-supporting hrt-font-regular hrt-text-button hrt-text-button--gray-dark hrt-text-button--underlined" data-tracking-id="fundraiser goal clicked"><span class="hrt-text-supporting hrt-font-regular">$3.5K</span> <span class="hrt-text-supporting hrt-font-regular"></span></button></h2><div class="hrt-text-body-sm hrt-text-supporting">6 donations</div></div></div><div class="donation-overview_footerContainer__w67U_"></div></div></div><div class="divider_divider__omN05 hrt-mt-0 hrt-mb-0 hrt-rule hrt-rule--horizontal"></div></div><div class="p-campaign-byline hrt-hide-max-md campaign-page_printHidden__yimHj"><div class="hrt-hide-max-md"><div class="m-campaign-byline"><div class="hrt-align-center hrt-disp-flex"><div class="hrt-position-relative hrt-mr-2"><button class="campaign-byline_avatarButton__OZdAb hrt-base-button" type="button" aria-label="Scroll to organizers"><div class="hrt-image-avatar hrt-avatar hrt-avatar--small hrt-avatar--neutral campaign-byline_heroMediaAvatar__UW0CP"><img alt="Profile photo of Tiffany  Chapman" height="24" src="https://images.gofundme.com/gmWBOLQ2_gKefsmA8vMtzcWEoV8=/128x128/https://www.gofundme.com/person/profiles/6b9fe30234e34a6caf94b6d2b5735d6f_edited_photo_1756187401381.jpeg" width="24"></div></button></div><div class="m-campaign-byline-description"><button class="hrt-no-underline hrt-text-left hrt-disp-inline campaign-byline_textButton___NfBw hrt-text-button hrt-text-button--gray-dark hrt-text-button--underlined" data-tracking-id="campaign byline: scroll to organizers" tabindex="0"><strong>Tiffany  Chapman</strong></button></div></div></div></div><div class="hrt-hide-min-md"><div class="m-campaign-byline"><div class="hrt-align-center hrt-disp-flex"><ul class="hrt-list-unstyled hrt-avatar-stack hrt-avatar-stack--horizontal hrt-mr-2"><li class="hrt-avatar-stack-item hrt-avatar-stack-item--0" style="z-index:1"><div class="hrt-image-avatar hrt-avatar hrt-avatar--large hrt-avatar--neutral hrt-avatar--surface-default"><img alt="Profile photo of Tiffany  Chapman" height="40" src="https://images.gofundme.com/gmWBOLQ2_gKefsmA8vMtzcWEoV8=/128x128/https://www.gofundme.com/person/profiles/6b9fe30234e34a6caf94b6d2b5735d6f_edited_photo_1756187401381.jpeg" width="40"></div></li></ul><div class="m-campaign-byline-description">Tiffany  Chapman is organizing this fundraiser.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="p-campaign-byline campaign-page_printOnly__DTAyG"><div class="m-campaign-byline"><div class="hrt-align-center hrt-disp-flex"><div class="hrt-position-relative hrt-mr-2"><button class="campaign-byline_avatarButton__OZdAb hrt-base-button" type="button" aria-label="Scroll to organizers"><div class="hrt-image-avatar hrt-avatar hrt-avatar--small hrt-avatar--neutral campaign-byline_heroMediaAvatar__UW0CP"><img alt="Profile photo of Tiffany  Chapman" height="24" src="https://images.gofundme.com/gmWBOLQ2_gKefsmA8vMtzcWEoV8=/128x128/https://www.gofundme.com/person/profiles/6b9fe30234e34a6caf94b6d2b5735d6f_edited_photo_1756187401381.jpeg" width="24"></div></button></div><div class="m-campaign-byline-description"><button class="hrt-no-underline hrt-text-left hrt-disp-inline campaign-byline_textButton___NfBw hrt-text-button hrt-text-button--gray-dark hrt-text-button--underlined" data-tracking-id="campaign byline: scroll to organizers" tabindex="0"><strong>Tiffany  Chapman</strong></button></div></div></div></div><div class="p-campaign-description"><div class="divider_divider__omN05 hrt-mt-0 hrt-mb-0 hrt-hide-max-md hrt-rule hrt-rule--horizontal"></div><div class="hrt-hide-max-md"><div class="campaign-page_printHidden__yimHj"><div class="hrt-py-2 hrt-disp-flex hrt-align-center"><span class="hrt-tag hrt-tag--accent-blue hrt-base-tag hrt-base-tag--default" data-tracking-id="donation protected pill" style="cursor:pointer"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hrt-icon hrt-icon--small" focusable="false" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16"><use href="/_next/static/images/core-16-31932264881037ffb159f5662c201e59c85112cd30a19ba18847913bfef4d15a.svg#gofundme-giving-guarantee"></use></svg>Donation protected</span></div></div></div><div class="hrt-hide-min-md"></div><div class="divider_divider__omN05 hrt-mt-0 hrt-mb-0 hrt-hide-max-md hrt-rule hrt-rule--horizontal"></div><div class="campaign-description_campaignDescription__6P_RU"><div class="campaign-description_content__C1C_5 hrt-mt-3 campaign-description_isOpen__4cQeG" data-testid="campaign-description" style="">My father passed away suddenly, and I am asking for help during this incredibly difficult time. This loss has been emotionally and financially overwhelming for me and my family, and I am doing everything I can to bring my dad home from Sainte Genevieve, Missouri to California. 
<br>
<br>
 The funds raised will go toward the costs of his funeral service, cremation, and the transportation needed to bring his remains back home to California. This happened so unexpectedly, and these expenses have added to the pain of losing him. 
<br>
<br>
 It is hard to ask for help because I have to do a service for my father and pay for everything, and all of this happened far too soon and unexpectedly. It feels like a lot to carry on top of this loss. 
<br>
<br>
 Asking for help is not easy, but any contribution would mean so much to me and my family. If you are unable to donate, sharing this fundraiser and keeping us in your thoughts and prayers would also help. Thank you for your kindness and support as we try to bring my dad home and give him a proper farewell.</div></div><div class="campaign-page_printHidden__yimHj"><div class="hrt-disp-flex hrt-align-center hrt-mt-4"><div class="hrt-spot-icon hrt-spot-icon--neutral-subtle hrt-spot-icon--large"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hrt-icon hrt-icon--default" focusable="false" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><use href="/_next/static/images/core-a1931ce288678834629d0cbab7a1e1264892b61692ec3c93b5f003ec36942c24.svg#location"></use></svg></div><span class="hrt-ml-2 hrt-text hrt-font-body hrt-text-default hrt-text-body-md">This fundraiser is located near you</span></div></div><div class="hrt-mt-4 campaign-page_printHidden__yimHj hrt-grid-columns hrt-grid-columns--2"><a class="hrt-button hrt-button--hierarchy-secondary hrt-button--layout-full hrt-button--size-large hrt-button--color-default hrt-base-button" data-element-id="btn_story_donate" href="https://www.gofundme.com/f/bring-my-dad-home-to-california/donate?attribution_id=sl%3A70349728-44b0-4030-90c6-98d9ff4e4f89&amp;lang=en_US&amp;ts=1790739798&amp;utm_campaign=man_sharesheet_dash&amp;utm_content=amp30-treatment-4&amp;utm_medium=customer&amp;utm_source=copy_link&amp;source=btn_story_donate" data-analytic-event-listener="true"><span>Donate</span></a><button class="hrt-button hrt-button--hierarchy-secondary hrt-button--layout-full hrt-button--size-large hrt-button--color-default hrt-base-button" type="button" data-element-id="btn_story_share" data-analytic-event-listener="true"><span>Share</span></button></div></div><div class="p-campaign-content"><div><section class="campaign-section_section__ggZDd p-campaign-donations hrt-hide-min-lg"><div class="divider_divider__omN05 hrt-mt-0 hrt-mb-0 hrt-mt-2 hrt-mb-2 hrt-rule hr